        <section id="variables" >
          
            <h2>Variables</h2>
              <p>A variable is a container of a specific <em>type of data</em> which has the potential to alter during the running of a program. Unlike a constant which is fixed, a variable needs to have the flexibility to change under certain conditions.</p>
<p>Thinking about this in the context of a computer game, you may have a constant in that you have 1 life or health bar for your character, however a variable would be the amount of health in that health bar. As you played the game you may lose or gain health and as you did, that variable would need to change based on what it was being told by the code, whereas the constant would need to stay the same for the game to function correctly.</p>
<p>Our example code starts with some variable declarations. Can you identify what <em>data types</em> the variables called variable_1 and variable_2?</p>

              
              <div class="c-code"><pre class="language-js"><code class="language-js"><span class="highlight-line"><span class="token comment">// Declare some variables</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line"></span><br><span class="highlight-line">  <span class="token keyword">var</span> variable_1 <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">25</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">  <span class="token keyword">var</span> variable_2 <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token number">28</span></span><br><span class="highlight-line">  <span class="token keyword">var</span> list_1 <span class="token operator">=</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token number">5</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">2</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">6</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">3</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">7</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token number">2</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span></span></code></pre>
